      <description><![CDATA[
        <h3>What's new in 1.1.0</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Premium: web licenses (buy on the web, redeem in-app) plus the new Premium page and titlebar status pill.</li>
          <li>Inspector: response/request body now scrolls horizontally and is fully selectable in both JSON and Raw views.</li>
          <li>Inspector: image URLs in a response show inline thumbnail previews — tap to view full size.</li>
          <li>Feature gates: consistent Pro limits across desktop (rules, scripting, compose, exports).</li>
          <li>Auto-update reliability and various fixes.</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
